<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0625_T28R0201_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">A RED GYARADOS showed up at the Lake\nof Rage!\rThat’s weird, ’cause even BLUE\nGYARADOS is rare there. Somebody did\fsomethin’.\fI got a theory. It’s The Feds.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0625_T28R0201_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My favorite radio show?\nHomie Music. It put me to sleep.\fIn a good way.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0625_T28R0201_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I been hearin’ LAUGHIN’ on the\nradio...\fLate at night...\fIt’s creepy, bro. I sleep with the\flights on now.</language>
	</row>
</body>
